<p>NOTE: Third quarter 1996 included $101,000 or $0.02 per share net realized capital gains vs $354,000 or $0.06 per share for same period last year. Net realized capital gains for the first nine months 1996 were $501,000 or $0.11 per share, versus $1.04 million or $0.18 per share for same period last year. Hurricane Fran cost the company $1.69 million in Q3 1996.</p>
